: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n            关于这支豆子的品种相关- Villa Sarchi / HdT / Sarchimor\n            <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           关于Villa Sarchi\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none;\">\n          它是波旁自然突变的品种，也被叫做La Luisa or Villalobos Bourbon, 是单一基因突变，所以它的树型比较小，它是在1950年代，哥斯达黎加的西部山谷产区的一个叫Sarchi的小镇被发现，于1957年左右在哥斯达黎加推行，1974年由洪都拉斯咖啡研究中心IHCAFE引入洪都拉斯，它适宜在高海拔种植，抗风性强，它与Lempira和IHCAFE90类似需要较多的肥力，且需要一定的遮阴环境。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none;\">\n           关于 HdT\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none;\">\n          在1917或者1927年，在当时还属于印尼的东帝汶岛，出现了阿拉比卡的铁皮卡与罗布斯塔自然杂交而得“混血”品种，被定义为Hybrid de Timor（简称HdT）；\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n          它就是卡蒂姆的爸妈里的一个，提供了优良的抗病（主要是叶锈病，也有其它咖啡的常见疾病）能力给卡蒂姆；\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n          1950年代在Timor岛开始流行起来，\n          <span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n           随后\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n          1958/59年，葡萄牙的咖啡叶锈病研究中心CIFC从收到的来自Timor岛的HdT品种中选择了两只叶锈病抗性较好的系列，分别是832/1与832/2开始实验种植；他们就是后来卡蒂姆和萨奇姆的“姆”的来源～\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n          HdT本身在印尼的传播大概是1978\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n          年左右引种种植到印尼的苏门答腊Sumatra岛和佛洛伦斯Flores岛。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 17px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-decoration: none;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           关于萨奇姆 Sarchimor\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none;\">\n          莎奇姆类似卡蒂姆，它是一个品种谱系家族，并非一个单一的品种，它是基于HdT 832/2与维拉莎驰Villa Sarchi杂交而得的品种，最早的一代代号为H361。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n<br/>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           关于Parainema\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none;\">\n          Parainema就是一个莎奇姆品种，葡萄牙的叶锈病研究中心在研发出莎奇姆的第一代H361后，在1971年将它推行到中南美洲、非洲以及亚洲的一些咖啡产国；同时期，为了应对日渐泛滥的叶锈病，中南美洲咖啡研究中心PROMECAFE于1978年成立；中美洲区域，H361首先到达的是哥斯达黎加的咖啡研究中心CATIE，在这里它获得了一个新的代号T5296(T代表了CATIE所在地Turrialba)，从这里原先的H361被以T5296的新代号进行立项和进一步的筛选研发，而Parainema就是洪都拉斯的咖啡研究中心IHCAFE从哥斯达黎加引种T5296筛选而得的洪都拉斯本土的莎奇姆品种。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none;\">\n          Sarchimor家族里还有我们在售卖的哥斯达黎加蓝色火山家的San Isdiro品种。\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Q5IrVl78oENAPK6XaF2KkEhtbA5WEnP43sb8KSq2JndQoOPs8PPxhpeakJicFoO9fOKzhibITowW0g/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          月桂庄园位于洪都拉斯南部六大产区中的帕拉伊索省丹利市附近偏西北方的山区，海拔1400米，年降雨量2000毫米。\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          得天独厚的地理环境和气候，使月桂农场具有生产高品质咖啡的先天条件，近20年的努力和改变，风味突出的小农批次逐渐展露头角，月桂庄园2017年在卓越杯夺冠，分数高达91.81分。\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Q5IrVl78oENAPK6XaF2KkEVbfQaQMLU4E1mMWJ9CbZyFiclwTpSOxicEVuBajBp3sBEhtSUSPmDMnw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          月桂庄园的种植沿袭几代人的传统，手工脱皮，用筛网干燥，用传统木质工具脱壳等等。帕拉伊内玛种是来自实验培育的混种，具有高度抗叶锈病与病虫害的优势，枝叶粗壮，却在风味上有颇为细腻的变化，豆型尖长。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Q5IrVl78oENAPK6XaF2KkERFnUNLVI1RTUKzwoUficbk0iawaU8kF9NibtggPaSx4URjTA6MVqbIv9Q/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"font-size: 14px;white-space: normal;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Q5IrVl78oENAPK6XaF2KkEMicKiaLj19RxP7myXeVGHeMbBxia1ebjH9r8bsU8LaujAB9w4Sgd1JQ9g/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"font-size: 14px;white-space: normal;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          本批次是刚刚结束的洪都拉斯IHCAFE Best of Parainema赛事里获得第二名哦～\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin: 0pt 6pt 0pt 0pt;font-family: 等线;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 16px;\">\n<span style=\"display: inline-block;overflow: hidden;transform: rotate(0deg);width: 604.733px;height: 806.311px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SEjWicAWBfJQH2JJ8V8JPXh8Xu6SFH5zIG0fsicMGBqEfwVlvaWSBkQULia87ZRWLiasvyKaO57gDpBQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\" style=\"width: 604.733px;height: 806.311px;\"/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          更多咖啡豆选购，请关注收藏小程序和淘宝店铺哦～\n         </span>\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RicESSboT2yAGicv25eicYwA9eYTVnj6tnDXYWHJ5amUjBqzNK6pdB5dhozgCKLqOuf9IgicGe5pVLibQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;visibility: visible !important;width: 578px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"10000\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
